{"id":"u-c7ed8d68-3070-490b-b50f-2c90affa66b3","src":"community","title":"Arms Domination (Upper Lower Arms)","author":"Snow","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/3f9qul-spider-physique-demolition-upper-lower-arms-1","desc":"Program breakdown: \nMonday - Upper\nTuesday - Lower\nWednesday - REST\nThursday - Upper\nFriday - Lower\nSaturday - Arms\nSunday - REST\n\nProgression Scheme: \nIt is important that you focus on adding weights as the primary driver of progression, although this program will serve as a double progression scheme in which you have a rep range (e.g. 6-8), and you must not add weight to your sets until you have achieved the top end of the rep range. Personally, I will add weight to set 1 if I reach 8 reps, but then use the same weight for set 2 as last week until I reach the 8 reps. \n\nThis program is designed based on HIT. It is okay to leave 1 RIR for larger muscle groups, but I typically like to go to failure for arms.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":69,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-28T02:05:46.411Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper 1","Lower 1","Upper 2","Lower 2","Arms/Shoulders"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bicep Curl (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":7,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":7,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"V-Handle Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}],"note":"The goal of this is to induce hypertrophy, but also to warm up the triceps tendon for the French press."},{"n":"Hammer Curl (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}]}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":7,"rpe":10,"x":2}],"note":"Focus on Triceps and try to use less chest."},{"n":"Seated Dip (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Wide Grip Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":10}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"rpe":10,"x"